      <marc:subfield code="a">A wonderful guide to each of the four seasons with emphasis on its effects on the natural world. Join us on a journey through nature with beautifully illustrated scenes that children will love. It&apos;s an engagingly simple look at the seasons and the changing weather. Discover what is happening as we move from season to season... Bees busy searching for nectar in summer Big changes when the leaves fall in autumn Bear&apos;s getting cozy and hibernating in winter Sunshine showers and rainbows in spring.</marc:subfield>
